%% HakiArdhi - Complete Data Flow
%% End-to-end journey of a message through the system

graph TB
    Start([Citizen Interaction<br/>WhatsApp]) --> Meta[META WHATSAPP API<br/>Cloud-based service]

    Meta --> Webhook[Webhook POST Request<br/>HTTPS with signature verification]

    Webhook --> Backend[HAKIARDHI BACKEND API<br/>/api/chatbot/webhook]

    Backend --> Security{SECURITY LAYER}
    Security --> S1[1. Verify signature]
    Security --> S2[2. Extract message]
    Security --> S3[3. Format phone number]
    Security --> S4[4. Check user session]

    S1 --> AI[AI PROCESSING<br/>OpenAI GPT-4]
    S2 --> AI
    S3 --> AI
    S4 --> AI

    AI --> AISteps[AI Actions:<br/>→ Load conversation history from DB<br/>→ Classify intent with confidence<br/>→ Determine if escalation needed<br/>→ Generate contextual response]

    AISteps --> Decision{Decision Point:<br/>Escalate or<br/>AI Response?}

    Decision -->|Escalate| Route[ROUTE TO SERVICE]
    Decision -->|AI Response| Generate[AI GENERATES RESPONSE]

    Route --> Services{Service Type}
    Services -->|Legal Aid| SL[Create legal_aid_requests record]
    Services -->|Incident| SI[Create incidents record]
    Services -->|Case Status| SS[Query cases table]

    SL --> Interactive[Generate interactive<br/>buttons/lists]
    SI --> Interactive
    SS --> Interactive

    Generate --> Response[Generate text response<br/>+ smart reply suggestions<br/>+ save to chatbot_logs]

    Interactive --> Format[FORMAT RESPONSE]
    Response --> Format

    Format --> Structure[Prepare WhatsApp message:<br/>• Message structure<br/>• Interactive components<br/>• Media if needed]

    Structure --> Log[LOG TO DATABASE<br/>chatbot_logs table]

    Log --> LogData[Store:<br/>• message_id<br/>• phone_number anonymized<br/>• message_text<br/>• intent_classified<br/>• response_sent<br/>• timestamp]

    LogData --> Send[SEND VIA WHATSAPP API<br/>POST to Meta Graph API<br/>Authorization: Bearer token]

    Send --> Deliver[Meta delivers message]

    Deliver --> Citizen([CITIZEN RECEIVES RESPONSE<br/>in WhatsApp])

    Citizen --> Reply[User reads & replies]

    Reply -.->|Cycle repeats| Start

    style Start fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
    style Meta fill:#00BCD4,stroke:#0097A7,color:#fff
    style Backend fill:#2196F3,stroke:#1565C0,color:#fff
    style Security fill:#FF9800,stroke:#E65100,color:#fff
    style AI fill:#9C27B0,stroke:#6A1B9A,color:#fff
    style Decision fill:#FF5722,stroke:#D84315,color:#fff
    style Log fill:#607D8B,stroke:#37474F,color:#fff
    style Citizen fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
